# Dockerfile-specific ignore file (BuildKit reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore`).
# The build context is the repository root, so exclude generated and unrelated
# trees. Everything the build needs is in Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock, crates/ and
# examples/.
.git
**/target
**/build
**/.wrangler
**/node_modules
bench
docs
godot
unity
*.wasm
